Code=78) → Pod 进入 CrashLoopBackOff (restarts=7)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因：**\nPod `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-kmfxx` 处于 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态的根本原因是**应用程序在处理请求时发生配置缺失异常**。\n\n具体证据支持如下：\n1.  **异常触发**：Elasticsearch 日志显示在崩溃前多次发生 `level=error` 的日志记录，明确指出 `message=\"CONFIG_MISSING\"`，且 `path=\"/work\"` 接口返回 `http_status=500`（见证据 #6）。\n2.  **机制确认**：Deepflow 流量记录证实了该 Pod 的 `/work` 接口确实持续返回 `status=500`，排除了网络或基础设施层面的连接问题（见证据 #7）。\n3.  **模式匹配**：Tempo 链路数据中的 `aiops.observed_mode=config_missing_exit` 将这种退出行为与配置缺失直接关联，确认进程因应用逻辑缺陷而非资源限制（OOM）或外部探针失败而退出（见证据 #8）。\n4.  **结果印证**：容器退出码为 `78`（见证据 #2），结合上述日志，证实了应用层崩溃导致了 Kubernetes 的重启循环。\n\n**未知/待确认事项：**\n*   导致 `CONFIG_MISSING` 的具体缺失 Key 名称：现有证据仅能证明配置项缺失，但无法指出具体是哪一个 Key 缺失（如 \"fact-1dfce90a25bc\" 中的具体上下文未展示）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.8m\n├─ 问题定位: 21.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 70.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-kmfxx: 70.1s (Evidence 59.1s, RCA 10.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 15.6s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-kmfxx**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 106.89, "metrics": {"run_id": "88e42fc8544d4074", "mttr": {"value": "1.8m", "seconds": 106.89249014854431, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "we